{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> PLAYNESE: Master Japanese</strong> is a JRPG adventure designed  <u><strong>for anyone learning Japanese</strong></u>, from absolute beginners to those preparing for Japanese Language Tests (like the JLPT).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/0c532aadcb49be0e6b8f5a7c74f8483b.avif?t=1755987000\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<u><strong>The Study-Play Game Loop</strong></u><strong>:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.</strong> Study Japanese &amp; take quizzes to earn money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2.</strong> Buy powerful cards and battle creatures from a mad scientist.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3.</strong> Unlock new areas with badges and explore the Open World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbHunt for rare cards, craft, trade, and build the ultimate deck!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/5fe017a561c4f39112e5271031b86628.avif?t=1755987000\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u30fbStudy using charts, mnemonics, and Japanese Language Test Quizzes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/96604fe02d9b03d88d3a40b7a2ac1906.avif?t=1755987000\" width=275 height=200 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/07dfa23e23363ceaae35fc03bee1728f.avif?t=1755987000\" width=231 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEarn badges to unlock new areas, tougher challenges, and exciting experiences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/21e50a2687ac0db0e3225f00cbb2ae59.avif?t=1755987000\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Absorb Japanese naturally while having fun</u>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u><strong>:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn and practice Hiragana (\u3072\u3089\u304c\u306a), Katakana (\u30ab\u30bf\u30ab\u30ca) and Kanji (\u6f22\u5b57)</strong> through interactive play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up your Japanese\u00a0</strong>with JLPT-aligned content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Japanese-themed cards</strong> to battle monsters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/6cd88aea67056117c52325f5d822218d.avif?t=1755987000\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStart your adventure today, and transform your Japanese learning journey into an unforgettable experience!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<u>EARLY ACCESS</u>: Weekly Updates with new features and quizzes based on feedback via YouTube, Discord and Social Media :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u307e\u305f\u306d\uff01\uff3c\uff08\uff3e\u25cb\uff3e\uff09\u4eba\uff08\uff3e\u25cb\uff3e\uff09\uff0f</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764890?t=1755987000","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764890?t=1755987000","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/816c98e0cb7536bc1fe08dd32dc449f94781fd29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755987000","capsule_imagev5"